n></a><a href="/admin/policies" class="tab-link"><svg class="tab-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h4M12 17h8"></path> <circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2"></circle> <circle cx="10" cy="17" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="tab-no" aria-hidden="true">07</span> <span class="tab-label">Rules</span> <span class="tab-short">Rules</span></a></div><div class="side-group side-group--foot"><a href="/admin/account" class="tab-link"><svg class="tab-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 21V8l8-5 8 5v13"></path> <path d="M9 21v-6h6v6"></path></svg><span class="tab-no" aria-hidden="true">··</span> <span class="tab-label">Account</span> <span class="tab-short">Account</span></a></div></nav><div class="side-foot"><p class="side-who"><span class="side-who-label">Signed in as</span> <span class="side-who-name"></span> <span class="side-who-role"></span></p><form method="post" action="/admin/logout"><button type="submit" class="btn btn--quiet side-signout">Sign out</button></form></div></div><main class="panel-main"><div class="panel-well">       <section class="border-l-4 border-saffron bg-saffron-lite px-4 py-4"><p class="font-display font-bold tracking-tight">No plaques have been loaded yet</p><div class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink/85"><p>No plaques have been loaded for this business yet, so nobody can tap in or out. Taptime encodes each plaque and loads it here; ask us for the ones you need and they will appear in stock, ready to mount.</p><p class="mt-2"><a href="/admin/locations" class="underline">Venues &amp; plaques</a>  shows every plaque this business has.</p></div></section> <p class="font-mono text-sm text-ink/85">Wednesday 5 August 2026 <span class="